    "message": "Document physical Metal TP QA preflight and native batch coverage\n\nCheck per-boot RDMA addressing and wired residency limits, match prefill chunk overrides on both ranks, and account for the extra sessions used by numerical oracles. Require at least three Metal TP rows when checking the native V4.1 path; two rows intentionally use ordered decoding.",
